def unique(xs):
    seen=set(); out=[]
    for x in xs:
        if x not in seen: out.append(x); seen.add(x)
    return out
Order follows the input loop. Integers are hashable; expected time O(n), space O(n). Tests: [] -> []; [2,1,2] -> [2,1]. These tests are proposed, not executed.

